    37	B. **Void v009 for Nov 8 and use the slot for e4b-v002h.** This needs your authorization plus the reverse SUBMIT_KERNEL config commit (kernel v2 output already BYTE_IDENTICAL). e4b-v002h has the same empty-diff property, so its review would raise the same issue if scoped the same way. This mainly moves the E4B validation a day earlier.
